            <description><![CDATA[<p><em>Launch at login can actually be switched on now.</em></p>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul><li>The launch-at-login switch was disabled before the attempt was ever made</li><li>If macOS refuses, its own reason is shown instead of a guess</li></ul>
<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul><li>When launch at login waits for your approval, one click opens System Settings</li></ul>
